</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.49</h2><ul><li><strong>Codex&#x27;s card shows the last model call&#x27;s speed.</strong> With Detailed card on under Settings → Providers → Codex → Panel, and Read local usage records on under Token spend, the first account&#x27;s card shows that speed and how long ago the call ended; after an hour the line is no longer shown. <a href="https://github.com/qunqin24/Pulse/issues/126">#126</a></li><li><strong>The Gemini provider is named Gemini CLI.</strong> Under Settings → Providers, and on the card&#x27;s title, that provider is now Gemini CLI, apart from the Gemini app.</li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.49">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
